    <briefdescription>
<para>Contains slow-to-obtain dynamic information. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The data reported in this structure requires milliseconds to be obtained.</para>
<para>The application should only call it in situation where the program flow can cope with an interruption of that magnitude.</para>
<para>Populated by <ref refid="ndigo__common__interface_8h_1af5c79932dced65c2b274b00dc5e6f71f" kindref="member">ndigo_get_slow_info</ref>. </para>
